# triclinic-reach.test on a device, with the neighbor matrix: a narrow
# tilted cell that a barostat shrinks until the pairlist distance is well
# beyond half of the least of a_x, b_y, c_z (#258, D[matrix-images]).
#
# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/triclinic_reach.py %t mdir GPU MATRIX | FileCheck %s

# CHECK:      79 frames, 79 with the reach beyond half of the least of the diagonal
# CHECK-NEXT: half of the least of the diagonal well below the reach
# CHECK-NEXT: frames whose potential is not the sum over all images: 0
